an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","jsx-a11y/iframe-has-title","<iframe> elements must have a unique title property.","'Modal' is defined but never used.","'man' is defined but never used.","'arrow' is defined but never used.","'useSelector' is defined but never used.","eqeqeq","Expected '===' and instead saw '=='.","BinaryExpression","unexpected","'useEffect' is defined but never used.","'facebook' is defined but never used.","'profile' is defined but never used.","'useDispatch' is defined but never used.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'talentId'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["806"],"Expected '!==' and instead saw '!='.","'emailAddress' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'verify'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["807"],"'res' is assigned a value but never used.","'axios' is defined but never used.","'showProfessionalInput1' is assigned a value but never used.","'setShowProfessionalInput1' is assigned a value but never used.","'showGuarantorRelationshipInput1' is assigned a value but never used.","'setShowGuarantorRelationshipInput1' is assigned a value but never used.","'item' is assigned a value but never used.","'ngnValue' is assigned a value but never used.","'submitForm' is assigned a value but never used.","no-redeclare","'btn' is already defined.","redeclared","'handlePayercoinsPayment' is assigned a value but never used.",{"range":"808","text":"804"},"'my_love' is defined but never used.","'kamala' is defined but never used.","'index' is assigned a value but never used.","'setIndex' is assigned a value but never used.","'carouselPple' is assigned a value but never used.","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.",{"range":"809","text":"804"},{"range":"810","text":"804"},{"range":"811","text":"804"},{"range":"812","text":"804"},"'InfoModal' is defined but never used.","'hover' is assigned a value but never used.","'setHover' is assigned a value but never used.","'sprint' is defined but never used.","'ToastContainer' is defined but never used.","'toast' is defined but never used.","'Linkedn' is assigned a value but never used.","'isLoading' is assigned a value but never used.","'submitted' is assigned a value but never used.","no-lone-blocks","Nested block is redundant.","BlockStatement","redundantNestedBlock","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'userDetails?.ageRange', 'userDetails?.haveKids', and 'userDetails?.maritalStatus'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["813"],"'final_data' is assigned a value but never used.","The true literal is not a valid dependency because it never changes. You can safely remove it.","Literal","'forHireContact' is defined but never used.","'AdminApi' is defined but never used.","'showModal' is assigned a value but never used.","no-dupe-keys","Duplicate key 'phone'.","ObjectExpression","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'nigerianStates.length'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["814"],{"range":"815","text":"804"},["800"],["801"],["816"],"Using target=\"_blank\" without rel=\"noreferrer\" is a security risk: see https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#link-type-noopener","JSXAttribute",["817"],"The href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as t